<!doctype html><html lang="id"><head><meta charset="utf-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1"><title>Persiapan Ujian — FRExam</title><link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@400;600;700;800&display=swap" rel="stylesheet"><style>:root{font-family:Inter,sans-serif;color:#1f2937}*{box-sizing:border-box}body{margin:0;min-height:100vh;padding:28px 20px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,#f4f7fb,#e8eef7)}.shell{max-width:860px;margin:auto}.card{overflow:hidden;background:#fffd;border:1px solid #fff;border-radius:24px;box-shadow:0 20px 42px #23395d18}.hero{padding:28px 31px;color:#fff;background:linear-gradient(115deg,#23395d,#365d92);position:relative;overflow:hidden}.hero:after{content:"✦";font-size:145px;color:#ffffff18;position:absolute;right:25px;top:-40px}.hero>*{position:relative}.top{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;gap:12px}.eyebrow{margin:0;color:#dce8f7;font-size:12px;font-weight:800;letter-spacing:1px}.hero h1{margin:9px 0 7px;font-size:27px}.hero p{margin:0;color:#e7effa}.out{border:1px solid #ffffff33;background:#ffffff18;color:#fff;border-radius:9px;padding:9px 12px;font:700 12px Inter;cursor:pointer}.content{padding:26px 31px}.grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:13px;margin:0 0 20px}.item{padding:15px;border:1px solid #e2ebf3;background:#f8fafc;border-radius:13px}.item small{display:block;color:#64748b;margin-bottom:6px;font-size:11px;font-weight:800;text-transform:uppercase}.item strong{color:#23395d}.quote{padding:16px;background:#e8eef7;border-left:4px solid #365d92;border-radius:11px;color:#23395d;line-height:1.6;font-size:13px}.check{display:grid;gap:11px;margin:22px 0;font-size:13px}.check label{padding:12px;background:#f8fafc;border:1px solid #e3ebf3;border-radius:10px}.start{border:0;border-radius:11px;padding:14px 18px;background:#23395d;color:#fff;font:800 14px Inter;cursor:pointer;box-shadow:0 9px 18px #23395d2d}.start:disabled{opacity:.5;cursor:not-allowed}.help{display:block;margin-top:10px;color:#64748b;font-size:12px}@media(max-width:650px){body{padding:0}.card{border-radius:0;min-height:100vh}.hero,.content{padding:25px 20px}.grid{grid-template-columns:1fr}}</style></head><body><main class="shell"><section class="card"><header class="hero"><div class="top"><p class="eyebrow">PERSIAPAN UJIAN · LANGKAH 2 DARI 3</p><form method="post" action="{{ route('logout') }}">@csrf<button class="out">Keluar ↪</button></form></div><h1>Halo, {{ auth()->user()->name }} ✦</h1><p>Pastikan semua informasi ujian sudah sesuai sebelum kamu mulai.</p></header><section class="content"><div class="grid"><article class="item"><small>Mata Pelajaran</small><strong>{{ $exam->subject }}</strong></article><article class="item"><small>Jumlah Soal</small><strong>{{ $questionCount }} soal</strong></article><article class="item"><small>Durasi Ujian</small><strong>{{ $exam->duration_minutes }} menit</strong></article><article class="item"><small>Nama Ujian</small><strong>{{ $exam->title }}</strong></article></div><p class="quote"><strong>Mode fokus akan aktif saat ujian dimulai.</strong><br>Halaman soal meminta layar penuh. Berpindah tab, keluar layar penuh, atau meninggalkan halaman akan tercatat dan dapat dilihat guru.</p><div class="check"><label><input type="checkbox" class="ready"> Saya siap mengerjakan ujian ini.</label><label><input type="checkbox" class="ready"> Saya memahami bahwa aktivitas keluar akan tercatat.</label></div><form id="start-form" method="post" action="{{ route('student.start') }}">@csrf<button class="start" disabled id="start" type="submit">Mulai Ujian & Aktifkan Mode Fokus →</button><small class="help">Izinkan layar penuh ketika browser memintanya.</small></form></section></section></main><script>const checks=document.querySelectorAll('.ready'),button=document.querySelector('#start'),form=document.querySelector('#start-form');checks.forEach(x=>x.onchange=()=>button.disabled=![...checks].every(y=>y.checked));form.addEventListener('submit',async event=>{event.preventDefault();button.disabled=true;button.textContent='Mengaktifkan mode fokus…';try{if(!document.fullscreenElement)await document.documentElement.requestFullscreen()}catch(error){}form.submit()})</script></body></html>
